      "message": "Coordination: 1260761 (exact zero imaginary part reads as real) fixes this entry, and 1260760 (write symbols that read as numbers between bars) fixes the six `|+i|` … `|+NaN.0|` entries from line 48 on. All three changes start from d763607. Whichever of them lands after this one turns its entries into XPASS failures, so that change needs to delete them as it lands, or this one rebased onto them.\n\nSeparately, the issues behind several entries exist now (#47 to #52 in the new tracker). Putting the number in the reason would point whoever fixes one at the entry to delete.",
